("and the error propagates to your handling (an error boundary or `useActionState` result) ⚠ verify error propagation for your entry point.","and the error propagates to your handling: for a `<form action>` function that throws, the uncontrolled field kept its text (it is only reset after success) and the error reached the caller; an error thrown inside an async transition reached the nearest error boundary in our React 19.3 test. Behaviour for `useActionState` and framework Server Actions differs, so check your entry point."),
